WEBVTT

00:06:57.727 --> 00:07:02.101
to make sure that there is enough space
for all the millions of things

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:03.976
I need to put into my handbag.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.393
But when I try and buy a handbag online,

00:07:06.417 --> 00:07:08.309
I just see a few pictures:

00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:12.101
the basic shape and color and size.

00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:13.667
But that's not enough, is it?

00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:16.226
To solve this problem,

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:20.726
LazLive has developed a platform
where actual sellers --

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:25.226
real people can share
information about clothes,

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.851
handbags, gadgets,

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:28.268
cosmetics --

00:07:28.292 --> 00:07:30.393
describing the products to you,